DESCRIPTION:The Pensacola Half Marathon & 5K starts and finishes at Commun
 ity Maritime Park inside the Blue Wahoos stadium on Sunday\, October 11 a
 t 7 AM. The half loops through historic North Hill\, crosses the Bayou Ch
 ico bridge\, passes through the downtown Historic District and returns to
  Maritime Park\, with a 4-hour limit\, about 18 minutes per mile. The 5K 
 can be run or walked. Parking is in the Wahoos stadium lot\, and there is
  no gear check.\nPrice: from $50\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes: Sunday 10/11 ·
